user.description:
Authorize via WeChat first:
1. Copy the 'WeChat login link' below and open it inside the WeChat app on your phone;
2. Log in to your Towngas account inside WeChat; after success it redirects back with a ?code= parameter;
3. Copy the full redirected URL (the one containing ?code=) from the address bar and paste it below — the integration will exchange it for a token.

The token itself lives ~2 hours, but the refresh_token stays valid for days; the integration silently refreshes every 30 minutes, so no frequent manual steps are needed. {detail}
